      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS AUSTRALIANA (1) hasn't raced since a midfield finish in the Vicbred Super Series Final two years ago, capping a successful juvenile season highlighted by a win in the Nutrien Final. Has joined Seaton Grima since and was readied with a recent trial win. The ace draw can see her make a winning return. ELEGANT STRIDE (3) showed improvement for third from the back row at Newcastle last week and has won third-up before so should be fitter again. Draws well and strikes at 50 per cent here. STITCHED UP DAN (4) drops in grade off the last attempt at Menangle and did a good job to win at this circuit and distance prior so can atone. MY ULTIMATE BUDDHA (7) draws for a trail and has first four claims.",
